  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n40 : 35 :: 35 : k\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nIn a proportion a : b :: c : d, a/b = c/d\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n40/35 = 35/k\n\n⇒ 40k = 35 × 35\n\n⇒ k = (35 × 35) / 40\n\n⇒ k = (5 × 7 × 5 × 7) / (5 × 8)\n\n⇒ k = (5 × 7 × 7) / 8\n\n⇒ k = 245 / 8\n\nk - 1 = 245/8 - 1\n\n⇒ k - 1 = 245/8 - 8/8\n\n⇒ k - 1 = (245 - 8) / 8\n\n⇒ k - 1 = 237 / 8\n\n**∴ k - 1 = 237/8**",
